OL,4,CTens of thousands of UK fridges        
OL,5,Csecured from hackers in secret         
OL,6,Cnationwide operation                   
OL,7,GA behind the scenes cyber-security     
OL,8,Goperation has taken place to secure    
OL,9,Gtens of thousands of fridges and       
OL,10,Gfreezers at major UK supermarkets,     
OL,11,Gwarehouses, restaurants, petrol        
OL,12,Gstations and stadiums from hackers,    
OL,13,Gthe BBC has learned.                   
OL,15,FRecent waves of cyber-attacks in       
OL,16,FEurope have seen tonnes of food        
OL,17,Fspoiled at hundreds of stores, causing 
OL,18,Fmillions of pounds of damage.          
OL,20,FFrance has blamed Iran for one of the  
OL,21,Fwaves of attacks that impacted its     
OL,22,Fsupermarkets, a claim Tehran denies.   
